flowchart TD
  CLI[Profile dependency and diagnostic options] --> PP[Original preprocessing with actual include identities]
  PP --> M{Dependency-only mode}
  M -->|yes| RULE[Quoted deterministic Make rule]
  M -->|no| CHECK[Check source output and dependency destinations]
  CHECK --> STAGE[Stage and seal dependency file]
  STAGE --> PIPE[Typed frontend optimizer and original backend]
  PIPE --> PRIMARY[Publish complete primary output]
  PRIMARY --> DEP[Publish staged dependencies]
  PIPE -->|failure| ABORT[Discard owned temporaries preserve prior outputs]
  CHECK -->|collision or directory| ABORT
  PP -->|source or preprocessing error| DIAG[Text or schema-one JSON diagnostic batch]
  ABORT --> DIAG
